msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"The captain of the Ryudo Family, Rikiya Shimabukuro, is pretty tough. They "
"call him the Fighting Viper."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"The guy's unmatched in a bare-knuckle brawl. And now that his boss is "
"getting on in years, he's the one supporting the Ryudo Family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"Thanks to him, their rivals, the Tamashiro Family haven't been able to lay "
"even a finger on their territory."
msgstr ""

